NAME
       id - print user and group IDs

SYNOPSIS
       id [-ugGn]

DESCRIPTION
       Print user and group information for the current process.

OPTIONS
       -u
           print only the user ID

       -g, -G
           print only the group ID

       -n
           print a name instead of a number

EXAMPLES
       id
       id -un

SEE ALSO
       whoami(1)
